<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds end firmer, near record high.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds end firmer, near record high.</headline>
<text>
<p>1610 GMT - Bonos closed firmer on Monday, but slightly off new record at 112.60, with gains exaggerated by light volume.</p>
<p>* 10-yr 8.8 pct T-bond 112.98 vs 112.40, yield 6.84 vs 6.97</p>
<p>* March future 112.52 vs 112.19 at Friday's close</p>
<p>* The 10-year spread ended at 107 bps from 111 bps</p>
</text>
